                <p>How do you add a new key-value pair to a dictionary?</p>
                <div class="quiz-option" onclick="selectQuizOption(this, true, 3)">dict["new_key"] = value</div>
                <div class="quiz-option" onclick="selectQuizOption(this, false, 3)">dict.add("new_key", value)</div>
                <div class="quiz-option" onclick="selectQuizOption(this, false, 3)">dict.append({"new_key": value})</div>
